00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:33.490
This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:37.550
September, 1587 - Dewa Province, Okitamagun - Yonezawa Castle

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:46.230
No matter how many times I'm here, I feel that this is a nice aesthete's residence, Lord Masamune.

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:50.670
This view is quite rare throughout the land.

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:52.960
In any case, Katakura.

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:59.140
I hear that the capital is holding some huge tea ceremony.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.250
And there's someone who can go up against the legendary Sen no Rikyū?

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:06.940
Some guy named Furuta?

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:16.820
The Chief Advisor has ordered us to go, again and again.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:22.480
He wants us to visit Kyoto.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:28.890
If we go, the Date family will be admitting defeat to the Chief Advisor.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:35.460
Your ambitions lie beyond Ōu and across all of Japan.

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:39.090
Don't be so hung up over something as petty as aesthetics.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:40.550
I understand.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.560
I understand completely.

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:45.300
But!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:58.990
I want to go! So badly!

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.350
Take Me to Kitano

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.380
Under my watch,

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.900
there are few people learning the classic way of the tea.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.390
Fewer than ten, if I include Takayama Ukon.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:19.470
You have changed your interests toward the southern lands and returned to glorious Japan.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:23.060
I am allowing Rikyū to teach you.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:25.350
Thank you very much.

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:29.840
I am not like the fastidious Ukon.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:31.660
I will do my best every day.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.780
Rikyū, how are preparations for the great tea ceremony?

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:46.260
It is tough teaching all of the participants the tea ceremony of imperfection.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:49.990
They are slowly accepting my ways.

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:54.720
I have invited Hechikan, too.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:04:00.010
I am looking forward to see who is the best aesthete.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.970
I did not tell you this in front of the Chief Advisor.

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:16.950
Let me teach you the main point in serving tea.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:23.580
A tea ceremony does not follow set procedures.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:29.320
You exhibit your own style through your own ways.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:37.000
Do not be swayed by others. That is the main point.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:40.110
The Chief Advisor does not seem to understand that.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:44.910
That is why he has attempted to make certain styles better than others.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.240
I am not pleased at how he has handled the upcoming ceremony.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:58.420
Spreading a superficial sense of imperfection all over Japan is worse than not spreading it at all.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:05.890
This is bad.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.240
If his statements are made public,

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:11.000
the Chief Advisor will lose all face.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.860
I'll pretend I didn't hear anything.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:19.010
No matter how superficial the Chief Advisor is,

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:23.340
it is safer for me to ignore the rants of this weird old man.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:34.120
I want to find a replacement for Rikyū during this tea ceremony.

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:40.160
If there's someone more famous than Rikyū,

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:43.150
I cannot overlook him as the ruler of the heavens.

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:46.860
Preferably someone from Hakata.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:50.020
Please think this through, Brother.

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.880
When I attack China and Korea,

00:05:53.470 --> 00:05:55.800
the people of Sakai become less useful for me.

00:05:56.140 --> 00:05:56.790
But!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.650
If he threatens me with what happened at Honnō-ji,

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.090
I will be forced to keep his mouth shut.

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:11.480
Nobunaga had done the same thing.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.640
Lord Nagamasu is learning the way of the tea!?

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:28.430
The Chief Advisor gave him permission.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:34.570
This indicates that we have not trained enough in the way of the tea.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.450
I would have understood if it was some contentious daimyo like Lord Hosokawa or Lord Gamō.

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:44.480
He would have allowed them to learn the way of the tea to quell dissent.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:47.280
But Lord Nagamasu?

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:50.180
He's making him a higher-ranked tea master?

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:53.700
Is the Oda name still that influential?

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:58.970
Oh well.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.930
Fame is more important than name.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:05.920
I shall spread my name across the nation as the bird of imperfection.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:11.130
I have no time for those half-assed nobles by birth who have no understanding of aesthetics.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:15.470
Is Hechikan here?

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.950
I, Ishida from the Ministry of Ceremonies, am here on behalf of the Chief Advisor...

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.180
What are you doing?

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:25.830
There is a water hole here.

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:31.580
I won't stop you if you want to get your pants dirty.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:33.940
Good morning! 

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:37.630
My prepared greeting has been wasted.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.270
Don't be so hung up over it.

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.150
Listen!

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:44.160
Yes, yes.

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:48.160
Our last messenger failed.

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:52.770
I am here to tell you directly what the Chief Advisor wants. 

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:56.290
Please come to the tea ceremony.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.420
You guys are so stubborn.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:04.900
I told you already that I am not interested.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:09.150
Please stop bothering my old, solitary life here.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:14.160
Why must I perform a tea ceremony in front of all those people?

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:17.450
Are you saying you won't come no matter what?

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:18.310
No, I won't.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:20.670
Then you shall die.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.110
I would like you to come, too.

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.970
You dirtied your pants to ask me.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.780
I am touched.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:07.470
Now it'll be rude for an old guy like me to refuse.

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.020
I can't accept this, Lord Furuta.

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.850
Now all the players are here.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:24.610
How dare you bow your head as a warrior?

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:31.440
Social order exists due to social classes...

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.130
The Master, along with Hechikan...

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.830
If I surpass all of these monsters in front of an audience,

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.640
I will be famous!

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:41.520
I will report this to the Chief Advisor.

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:44.950
This tea ceremony will decide everything.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:52.210
The one who will sit on top of the aesthete's throne,

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:55.710
October 1st - Kyoto, Kitano Tenman-gū

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.020
will be me, Furuta Oribe!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.450
Master Fukushima and Master Katō.

00:10:09.560 --> 00:10:12.080
Thank you for providing security to the tea ceremony.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:16.690
As expected of the wild cattle and the fierce tiger of the Toyotomi army.

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:21.720
Even on paper mache animals you both still look as intimidating as ever.

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:27.070
This tea ceremony of imperfection has gathered forth every tea master in the nation.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.790
There is such heavy security to preserve the sanctity of the ceremony.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.460
I am deeply touched.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.470
We feel proud to receive your compliments, Lord Furuta.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:39.780
That's right.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:45.110
I, Fukushima Masanori, am envious of you.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:50.130
We wanted to be at the ceremony like you,

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:53.810
but the Chief Advisor denied us.

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:56.800
He is still immature.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:01.100
I will prepare a table in the afternoon and invite you both for tea.

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:06.940
He's the first lord to arrive and prepare?

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.590
He's quited hyped.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:12.530
That's right.

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:18.380
But I don't think Lord Furuta can beat Master Rikyū.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:25.800
I was invited to Master Rikyū's tea ceremony a few days ago.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:30.480
I had defeated countless warriors in my battles.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:36.290
I did not fear Lord Nobunaga, either.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:40.140
But... but...

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.350
I was scared out of my mind.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.460
I still don't understand why I was so scared.

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.130
Lord Furuta does not exert that sense of pressure.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.480
Me, too.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.570
When I was invited by Master Rikyū,

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:01.720
I felt he was amazing.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:06.480
I didn't understand anything about tea so I only looked at his face.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:10.310
He was so calm and serene.

00:12:11.340 --> 00:12:15.590
There was nothing unnatural about him.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:24.060
Just like how a tiger erases all of his bloodlust when he closes in on his prey.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:28.810
If he was a warrior, he would have surpassed the very best.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:31.110
That's right.

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.260
I'm sorry, Lord Furuta.

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.710
But it's clear who is number one here.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.450
Thank you all for coming!

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:46.390
We shall now begin the tea ceremony here at the forests of Kitano to celebrate the poet, Sugawara no Michizane!

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:52.030
Please feel free to take a look at the treasures on display here.

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:54.830
When you're done looking at the treasures,

00:12:55.410 --> 00:13:00.340
Rikyū, Tsuda Sōgyū,  Imai Sōkyū, and I will serve tea to everyone.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:06.560
Please understand the true beauty of Japan before you return to your homes.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.920
Are preparations for the ceremony ready?

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:14.190
Yes.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:18.090
Don't give me that unsatisfied look.

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:23.150
I've already decreased the influences from China and Korea and the amount of gold used.

00:13:24.180 --> 00:13:28.800
Even if this is a ceremony of imperfection, I need to keep my face as the ruler of the heavens.

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:31.940
Take a look!

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:34.740
The citizens are so happy!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:47.140
A Shōka tea pot, a Chidori incense burner, and a solid iron kettle!

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:49.560
It's not just the triumvirate!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.470
The Chief Advisor has these treasures, too!?

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:56.810
We may not have seen all of Lord Nobunaga's treasures,

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.810
but the Chief Advisor may have surpassed him already.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.460
Lord Hosokawa and Lord Gamō are both so young.

00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:09.310
Thy're getting all flustered by all of these treasures.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:15.540
My maturity really amazes me sometimes.

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:21.680
These Chinese treasures lie here in front of my eyes and I don't even flinch.

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:32.040
Only by experiencing true imperfection have I been able to shed myself of such desires.

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:42.960
Look at those sightly curves!

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.940
This is the famed Ōtomo Gourd.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.430
Such a thing exists among the Chinese treasures?

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:54.840
Something feels different about the Narashiba.

00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:57.770
Please accept this.

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:07.140
This is Narashiba's cover.

00:15:08.110 --> 00:15:12.090
The one that the Chief Advisor has is a fake.

00:15:16.110 --> 00:15:17.790
Master Tsuda, the tea ceremony is starting!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:20.660
Many people are waiting in line for you!

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:22.870
Let's go!

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:25.930
It's rude to let the guests wait!

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.570
There are over 100 guests here already for the tea ceremony.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.190
That number will surpass 200 by noon.

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:45.600
The guests are all waiting for the Chief Advisor or Master Rikyū.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:47.980
If that's the case...

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:53.130
If I cannot serve 300 guests,

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:58.010
I will not become the king of this ceremony?

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:05.450
What amazing skill, Chief Advisor!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:12.790
I apologize for coming at such a busy time.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:18.930
What a plain 4.5 tatami tea room.

00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:24.540
He is not using his trump card, the Chōjirō imayaki tea bowl.

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:29.530
Seems like Master has given up on this tea ceremony.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:33.930
I heard you were holding a ceremony in the afternoon.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:35.370
Yes.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.280
I told Lord Nagamasu already.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:43.670
I do not approve of this ceremony.

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:48.700
But if you are serious about this,

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:55.130
please allow our guests to experience the true beauty of imperfection.

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:02.680
Is this... the Master relinquishing his throne!?

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:07.670
Only Hechikan remains!

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:11.470
I can see it.

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:15.260
The summit in the midst of the haze!

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.920
Nagataka, you've grown so big.

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:26.850
How are you doing in Kiyosu?

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.300
No need to worry, Father.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:33.830
Don't you want to spread the Nagamasu tea ceremony on this grand stage?

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:35.740
I just finished my mansion.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:40.300
I need to find a woman that can talk aesthetics with me.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.990
I'll keep this a secret from Mother in Osaka.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:46.920
You have gotten smarter.

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:53.890
You're letting me drink while standing?

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:55.340
That's right.

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:59.270
Throwing away all extras is the keystone of imperfection.

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:03.780
A half tatami is enough for the Hosokawa Tadaoki tea ceremony.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:04.950
Tadaoki!

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:15.670
You idiot son. Stop embarrassing the family any longer.

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:19.400
That's Master Hosokawa Yūsai...

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:23.060
No one can relax at such a tea ceremony.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:27.020
Don't turn into someone like Tadaoki.

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:32.200
He is unable to catch the hearts of people even while chasing after imperfection.

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:38.430
Lord Nagamasu, how about some tea?

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:43.950
Lord Gamō, this is beyond plain.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:48.260
We were both sick with the flair of the southern lands. I feel so sad.

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:52.770
My passion is lacking. I am sorry.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:58.880
Oh? A Chinese pearl tea bowl, a favorite of my late brother?

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:03.860
I would like us to take this time to remember Lord Nobunaga.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:08.690
Have you attended Lord Furuori's tea ceremony?

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:10.560
Furuori?

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.850
There's quite a line.

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:17.270
He created something unheard of, a tea room two stories tall.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:36.830
I understand now, Father.

00:19:38.050 --> 00:19:42.480
I should just be like Lord Furuta!

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:43.650
Idiot!

00:19:55.680 --> 00:20:00.800
250 guests counting you, Master Ueda.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:02.710
Excuse me.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.150
After you open the window, you get a fabulous view.

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:16.400
You feel like bursting out in song like a swallow on top of a tree!

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:21.390
I took seven whole days to find a suitable tree and the suitable view.

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:26.160
I want them to feel as transient as a bird in flight while they enjoy their tea.

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:28.960
Seems like my hard work has paid off.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:31.810
This is imperfection.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:36.170
It moves... It moves my heart so!

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:38.470
You are the best!

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:42.040
You have surpassed all of the other aesthetes!

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:45.280
Excuse me.

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:47.380
Welcome, Lord Ishida.

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:50.340
How about a cup of tea?

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:53.040
How rude of you, Lord Furuta.

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:58.900
Did you forget that the Chief Advisor and all of the other nobles are down there in the forest?

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.550
You dare hold a tea ceremony above their heads?

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:07.180
You seem drunk in your own desires.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:10.020
What are you saying? That's insane!

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:14.130
In any case, you are being very rude to the Chief Advisor.

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:16.360
Stop this immediately!

00:21:21.040 --> 00:21:22.560
Stop your madness!

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.300
I'm taking your kettle.

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:25.910
What are you doing!?

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:35.430
Let go! Give it back! Let go! Give it back! Let go! Give it back!

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:51.950
Who has the most guests right now, Hidenaga?

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:56.430
It seems to be Lord Furuta, by recent accounts.

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:01.580
But I don't think anyone can beat Master Rikyū.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:17.640
My summit... My dreams...

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:26.650
If Kamiya Sōtan make it in time from Hakata,

00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:30.830
I can go support him.

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:06.150
Everytime I　

00:23:03.420 --> 00:23:06.150
Anata no mune

00:23:06.310 --> 00:23:08.540
feel your heart

00:23:06.310 --> 00:23:08.540
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:14.630
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:14.630
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:20.810
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:20.810
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:26.970
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.660 --> 00:23:26.970
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.810 --> 00:23:33.060
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.810 --> 00:23:33.060
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:36.940
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.060 --> 00:23:36.940
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:40.520
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:40.520
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.720 --> 00:23:46.390
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.720 --> 00:23:46.390
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.490 --> 00:23:49.390
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.490 --> 00:23:49.390
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.470 --> 00:23:52.000
Without each other.

00:23:49.470 --> 00:23:52.000
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:52.960
You should

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:52.960
Soshite

00:23:53.050 --> 00:23:58.460
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.050 --> 00:23:58.460
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:02.250
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:02.250
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.310 --> 00:24:07.960
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.310 --> 00:24:07.960
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:14.450
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:14.450
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:20.250
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:20.250
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:26.230
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:26.230
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.230 --> 00:24:35.430
About 20 people?

00:24:39.890 --> 00:24:41.470
Is this imperfection?

00:24:46.180 --> 00:24:47.930
Less is more.

00:24:50.620 --> 00:24:52.440
Start From the Beginning Again.

00:24:53.330 --> 00:24:54.530
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.440 --> 00:24:57.870
That is the question.

00:24:56.400 --> 00:24:59.490
Start From the Beginning Again
